        <div class="notes" id="notes-7679549" data-guid="7679549"></div>
        <div id="questions-7679549" data-guid="7679549" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7679549_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">The Board of Contract and Supply shall have an office in the City Hall, which shall be kept open from 9:00 a.m. in the morning until 5:00 p.m. in the afternoon of each day, except Sundays and legal holidays.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h3"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 7679550 child"
      id="7679550"
      data-guid="7679550"
      data-parent-guid="7679548"
      data-position="1185"
      data-full-title="§ 42-148: Meetings; minutes."
      data-code-content-type="section"
  >
    <span class="selectionBox material-icons material-symbols-outlined material-symbols-and-filled md-24"
         title="Select this content"
         aria-label="Select this content"
    >
      <input type="checkbox" class="selectionBoxInput" id="7679550_input"/>
    </span>
    <label class="selectionLabel" id="7679550_label" for="7679550_input">
  <div class="titleLinkContainer">
    <a href="#7679550"
       class="titleLink"
    >
    <span class="titleNumber">
      § 42-148
    </span>
    <span class="titleTitle"
          data-guid="7679550"
    >
Meetings; minutes.    </span>
    </a>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-7679550" data-guid="7679550"></div>
        <div id="questions-7679550" data-guid="7679550" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7679550_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="history">[Amended <span class="legref" data-ref=""><span class="hisdate">2-24-2011</span> by <span class="loclaw">Ord. No. 4.21.11</span></span>]</div><div class="para">The regular meetings of said Board shall be held at its office on the first and third Tuesdays of each month, at such hour as may be fixed by the Board. Special meetings of said Board shall be held at any time upon the call of the Mayor. The minutes of each meeting shall be distributed to each member of the Board to the Common Council, and to each department head within two weeks of each meeting. At the end of the year the minutes shall be indexed and maintained in a separate binder.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h3"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 7679551 child"
      id="7679551"
      data-guid="7679551"
      data-parent-guid="7679548"
      data-position="1186"
      data-full-title="§ 42-149: Presiding officers."
      data-code-content-type="section"
  >
    <span class="selectionBox material-icons material-symbols-outlined material-symbols-and-filled md-24"
         title="Select this content"
         aria-label="Select this content"
    >
      <input type="checkbox" class="selectionBoxInput" id="7679551_input"/>
    </span>
    <label class="selectionLabel" id="7679551_label" for="7679551_input">
  <div class="titleLinkContainer">
    <a href="#7679551"
       class="titleLink"
    >
    <span class="titleNumber">
      § 42-149
    </span>
    <span class="titleTitle"
          data-guid="7679551"
    >
Presiding officers.    </span>
    </a>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-7679551" data-guid="7679551"></div>
        <div id="questions-7679551" data-guid="7679551" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7679551_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">The Mayor shall be the President of said Board and shall preside at all meetings. In the absence of the Mayor, a presiding officer shall be selected by the members of the Board from among their number.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h3"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 7679552 child"
      id="7679552"
      data-guid="7679552"
      data-parent-guid="7679548"
      data-position="1187"
      data-full-title="§ 42-150: Quorum."
      data-code-content-type="section"
  >
    <span class="selectionBox material-icons material-symbols-outlined material-symbols-and-filled md-24"
         title="Select this content"
