  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-7679552" data-guid="7679552"></div>
        <div id="questions-7679552" data-guid="7679552" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7679552_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">A majority of the members of said Board shall constitute a quorum for the transaction of business.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h3"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 7679553 child"
      id="7679553"
      data-guid="7679553"
      data-parent-guid="7679548"
      data-position="1188"
      data-full-title="§ 42-151: Rules."
      data-code-content-type="section"
  >
    <span class="selectionBox material-icons material-symbols-outlined material-symbols-and-filled md-24"
         title="Select this content"
