       class="titleLink"
    >
    <span class="titleNumber">
      § 42-164
    </span>
    <span class="titleTitle"
          data-guid="7679595"
    >
Second Class Cities Law.    </span>
    </a>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-7679595" data-guid="7679595"></div>
        <div id="questions-7679595" data-guid="7679595" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7679595_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">Except as herein amended, § <a class="statref" href="https://municipal.codes/NY/SCC/120" target="_blank">120</a> of the Second Class Cities Law, as amended by Chapter 1018 of the Laws of 1970, and as authorized by Chapter 579 of the Laws of 1972, amending the <a class="statref" href="https://municipal.codes/NY/GMU/" target="_blank">General Municipal Law</a>, as amended by Chapter 336 of the Laws of 1973, is hereby ratified and confirmed.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
      </div>
  </div>

            </div>
          </div>
        </main>
